Name: Mozilla Root Certificates
URL: https://hg.mozilla.org/projects/nss
Version: N/A
Revision: N/A
CPEPrefix: cpe:/a:mozilla:nss
Security Critical: yes
License File: LICENSE.MPLv2
License: MPL-2.0

Description:
  Root certificates provided by Mozilla and converted into a PEM format (cert.pem).
  This package tracks the same upstream as google3. The raw certificates are
  automatically imported from google3 //security/cacerts/mozilla:roots.pem.

Local Modifications:
  None. The cert.pem file is automatically rolled from google3.
